BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Reading Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261207T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261207T180000
UID:6aa18baf4ea230006f336426@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For ages 6 to 8 with a parent or caregiver. Please register O
 NCE for your 2 participants (child and caregiver).\n(Re)discover the joy 
 of reading in this relaxed family program for kids and their parents or ca
 regivers. Each week\, explore a new story or the next chapter of a favouri
 te book together. Then\, head on your own reading adventures and enjoy ind
 ependent reading and playful story remixing with family and friends.\nThis
  is a 6-week program and participants are recommended to attend all 6 sess
 ions.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this fo
 rm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries A
 ct\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used
  for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions a
 bout how the library handles your information can be directed to Answerlin
 e staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toront
 o ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Lower level program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa18baf4ea230006f336426
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Perler Beads
