DESCRIPTION:Join Upper Toronto Community Robotics for accessible\, hands-o
 n robotics and engineering workshops for youth! These programs will help y
 ou build foundational skills in engineering design\, safety\, CAD software
 \, 3D modeling\, and introductory robotics coding.\nThis month's theme: Co
 ntrol Systems\nThis program is for youth in grades 6-12.\nIt is highly rec
 ommended to attend each session to build on your learning.\nPlease regist
 er online.
