BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dino Bites
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T170000
UID:6aa2ff0b65abe8002a782e28@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For Ages 7-12\nJoin us for an opportunity to handle\, examine 
 up close and discuss nine real and replica fossils in this fascinating han
 ds-on workshop. Participants will be entertained and educated\, not just a
 bout the fossils themselves\, but the palaeontological aspects that underp
 in them. Concepts include: evolution\, fossilization\, ‘The Tree of Life
 ’ (phylogeny) and — of course — dinosaurs!\nDrop-in. Spaces are limi
 ted.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa2ff0b65abe8002a782e28
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
