DESCRIPTION:Spend an afternoon at our weekly drop-in knitting and crochet 
 circle! Bring your work in progress and enjoy visiting with other knitters
  and crocheters. A great place to show off your work\, get advice\, swap i
 deas\, or just relax and visit with fellow fiber enthusiasts.\nBeginners 
 and all ages welcome! A limited supply of materials will be available.
