DESCRIPTION:This is Part 1 of a 2 PART program on Scratch Coding for Kid
 s. In Part 1 you will explore how to design your own customized sprites/ch
 aracters. The characters will be designed for a game that you code yourse
 lf in Scratch during Part 2. BE SURE TO SIGN UP FOR BOTH DAYS!\nThis class
