DESCRIPTION:Ever wonder what a city for goblins and ghouls would look lik
 e?\nLet’s create a spooky town together! Build a monster school\, ghost 
 library\, witch hospital\, vampire gym\, alien pizza shop\, mermaid park\,
  or any other place you can image with recyclables. Add cobwebs and spider
 s\, and showcase your terrifying creation for Halloween!\nFor children age
 s 4-12 and their families.\nRegistration is required. Please only register
  the children that will be participating\, accompanying adults do not need
  to register.
LOCATION:Leaside\, community room
