UID:6ac7f2c3de300e00451929ff@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Rili Budding Scientists’ Lab\, aims to provide children with
  an immersive and stimulating learning experience in the field of science 
 by offering interactive experiments\, educational resources\, and knowledg
 eable mentors who nurture their curiosity\, develop critical transferable 
 skills and inspire a lifelong love for STEM (Science\, Technology\, Engine
 ering and Mathematics).\nDrawing Jitter Bot:\nConstruct a drawing robot th
 at creates unique art through motion and simple engineering. Learning Foci
 : Robotics and vibration motion\nThis program is for\nChildren Ages 6-12\n
 Registration required.
