DESCRIPTION:Ready for Halloween? The library is just the place to be!\nWe 
 are hosting a fun and spooky Haunted Halloween Open House. Dress up like y
 our favourite character and get ready to be spooked!\nThe Haunted Hallowee
 n Open House will occur on the following days/times:\nWednesday\, October 
 28\, 4:30pm - 6:30pm\nThursday\, October 29\, 4:30pm - 6:30pm\nFriday\, Oc
 tober 30\, 4:30pm - 6pm\nSaturday\, October 31\, 11:30am - 1pm\nYou may pi
 ck your level of scariness each time you visit the Haunted Halloween Open 
 House:\nLevel One\n(Best for ages 4-7): Lights stay on\, music is fun\, 
 skips scariest room\, no jump scares.\nLevel Two\n(Best for ages 9-12): L
 ights are off\, scary music\, no jump scares.\nLevel Three\n(Best for age
 s 13+): Lights are off\, scary music\, there will be jump scares.\nPleas
 e note this is a drop-in program\, and open to all ages.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Auditorium\, located at the lower level
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a973d0f69166f088b96961c
