DESCRIPTION:Knights in the Library is a casual drop-in chess program open 
 to players of all ages and skill levels. Stop by to play a friendly game\,
  practice your strategy\, and meet other chess enthusiasts in the communit
 y. Whether you are a beginner learning the basics or an experienced player
  looking for a challenge\, everyone is welcome at the board.\nFamilies are
  welcome. Children should be able to play independently and are expected t
 o use respectful library behaviour so everyone can enjoy their games. Care
 givers are responsible for supervising their children throughout the progr
 am.
