DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261130T235959
UID:6abfe43a9dbc2b002c8bcccd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us throughout November as we celebrate the\n60th annivers
 ary of Mimico Centennial Library\n! Take a walk through history with our s
 pecial\nhistorical photo display\n\, featuring images and newspaper articl
 es of the library and surrounding Mimico community through the years. Disc
 over how our neighbourhood has changed and revisit the people\, places\, a
 nd moments that have shaped our community.\n60 years of stories. 60 years 
 of memories. 60 years of community.
