BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:After School Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T170000
UID:6a88a653aafa6100295e3112@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun!\nFor ages 6-12.\nRegistration is required.\nSnacks are offered durin
 g the After School Club for participants\, beginning at 3:45pm. Ingredient
  lists will be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by d
 onors.\nUpcoming Topics:\nMon Sept 14: Dash Robotics\nMon Sept 21: Craft\
 nMon Sept 28: SNAP circuits\nMon Oct 5th: Dash robotics\, In this program
 \, learn about Kids Vote Weekend!\nMon October 19th: Craft\nMon October 26
 th: SNAP circuits\nMon November 2nd: SPHERO robotics\nMon November 9th:Cra
