BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Magical Kitties Save the Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261110T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261110T170000
UID:6ac43b9d377296003a49f9d6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:People are mysteriously disappearing in River City and their f
 ellow humans don't seem to notice or miss them. Where could they be going 
 and what could have happened to them? It might have been your human\, or t
 he human of a kitty you know\, but the only clues you have point to the ma
 in branch of the River City library. Can you find out what’s going on\, 
 and more importantly can you rescue the missing humans?\nMagical Kitties S
 ave the Day is a role-playing game for players 6 and up in which you the p
 layer assume the role of a magically endowed feline who secretly looks aft
 er your human as well as the larger community. Nobody knows about your mag
 ical powers\, and you need to keep it that way!\n*For children ages 6-12. 
 Registration is required.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Room B/C
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac43b9d377296003a49f9d6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
