 n robotics and engineering workshops for youth! These programs will help y
 ou build foundational skills in engineering design\, safety\, CAD software
 \, 3D modeling\, and introductory robotics coding.\nThis month's theme: Vi
 sion Systems in Robotics.\nThis program is for youth in grades 6-12.\nIt i
 s highly recommended to attend each session to build on your learning.\nP
 lease register online.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a14e590caf93436005e4bc0
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
