DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages 6-12.\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for 
 participants are free of the top 10 priority allergens in Canada: peanuts
 \, tree nuts\, milk\, eggs\, seafood\, soy\, wheat\, sesame seeds\, mustar
 d and sulphites. ​Ingredient lists will be available.\nSnacks are genero
 usly supported\, in part\, by donors.\nIf you or your child lives with a d
 isability\, and requires an accessibility accommodation to participate in 
 this program\, please contact Accessibility Service by email\naccessiblese
 rvices@tpl.ca\nor voicemail\, 416-393-7099\, to make a request. Please con
 tact at least three weeks in advance.
