DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261015T170000
UID:6aa9828356fe62004a2fded9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For children ages\n6-12 years old.\nPlease note: some programs begin
  15 minutes early to allow for two separate sessions for younger and older
  children.\nBetween 3:30 and 4:00\, snacks are offered during the After Sc
 hool Club for participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are
  generously supported\, in part\, by donors.\nThursday\, October 1: Board 
 Games\nThursday\, October 8: Building Challenges\nThursday\, October 15: 
  Pawsitivley Pets\nLearn about animals in a fun and interactive way.  Liv
 e animals will be part of the presentation.  For children ages 4 and up.\
 nThursday\, October 22:  Robotics  2 SESSIONS:\nJUNIORS  3:45 - 4:25 f
 or children ages 6 and 7\nSENIORS  4:30 - 5:15 for children ages 8-12\nT
 hursday\, October 29: Halloween Party  Celebrate at the library with craf
 ts\, games\, and a scavenger hunt.  The craft will be separated into 2 SE
 SSIONS:\nJUNIORS  3:45 - 4:25 for children ages 6 and 7\nSENIORS  4:30 - 5
 :15 for children ages 8-12
