UID:6aac7f17ab7a8e0037c2a514@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun!\nFor ages 6 to 12 years old.\nSnacks are offered during the After Sc
 hool Club for participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are
  generously supported\, in part\, by donors.\nMonday\, October 26 - worksh
 op with ICE Robotics!\nLEGO® Education SPIKE™ Prime is a versatile robo
 tics learning system that combines LEGO building\, motors\, sensors\, and
  coding. It gives students the opportunity to turn their ideas into worki
 ng robots and bring them to life through programming.\nIn our program\, s
 tudents learn robotics\, coding\, engineering\, problem-solving\, and log
 ical thinking through fun\, hands-on projects and challenges. They also d
 evelop creativity\, critical thinking\, teamwork\, communication\, and co
 nfidence—building practical skills they can use in school and beyond.\n
 Information Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is c
