BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:After School Club: Paper Frog
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261016T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261016T170000
UID:6aad91f63dd190003e72f25c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come to our After Sc
 hool Club to learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids\, and have fu
 n! For\nages 6 to 8 years.\nFriday\, October 2nd\n-\nTree Candidate Button
  & Poster Making\n: Prepare buttons and flyers for the upcoming Tree Candi
 date Election 2026!\nFriday\, October 9th\n-\nDash/Sphero Coding\n: Learn 
 simple programming to move robots and accomplish a task\n.\nFriday\, Octob
 er 16th\n-\nPaper Frog\n: Make an easy paper frog and bring it home.\nFrid
