DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T170000
UID:6aac3677129d8e0031f3095c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:An election is happening!\nAre you interested in democracy? Ar
 e you curious about how an election works? Join us at the library where yo
 u will create your very own campaign poster. All materials will be provide
 d.\nThis program is intended for children aged 6 to 12 years.\nThis is a d
 rop-in program.\nToronto's municipal election takes place on October 26\, 
 2026. Check out the\nKnowYourVote.TO\nwebsite and the\nCelebrate Democracy
 \npage to learn more about the upcoming election\, access important voter 
 resources\, and discover activities and interactive library programs for a
 ll ages happening at a branch near you.\nThis initiative is made possible 
 by donations to the Toronto Public Library Foundation and is generously su
 pported by the McConnell Foundation.
